    m_Localized: Complimental Clash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26257133568
    m_Localized: When hitting an enemy with a spell colored to the complementary
      color of the enemy the enemy takes +{totbuff_0} (+{buff_0} per item) damage.
      Complimentary colors are yellow-purple, red-green, and blue-orange.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6789064481223999594
  - m_Id: 141448679562317824
    m_Localized: 'When attacking an enemy with a complimentary color the spell does
      an extra +{buff_0} damage. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6789064481223999594
  - m_Id: 141448696909959168
    m_Localized: Complimentary colors are always fun to paint with.
